WEBVTT

00:00:00.642 --> 00:00:06.547
Welcome to PDF Do, a free PDF studio that works completely offline.

00:00:06.547 --> 00:00:09.456
There is no sign in and no cloud.

00:00:09.456 --> 00:00:14.480
In this video you will learn how to use it, step by step.

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:16.101
Step one:

00:00:16.101 --> 00:00:17.990
download and install.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.928
On the website, click Download for Windows, then run PDF Do Setup.

00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:30.405
It installs for your user only, so you do not need administrator rights.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:36.972
If Windows SmartScreen shows a warning, click More info, then Run anyway.

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:38.607
Step two:

00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:41.561
open PDF Do and click Open a PDF.

00:00:41.561 --> 00:00:52.214
You can also press Control O, drag files onto the window, or right click a PDF in Explorer and choose Open with PDF Do.

00:00:52.214 --> 00:00:55.078
Every file opens in its own tab.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.962
Step three:

00:00:56.962 --> 00:00:59.814
pick a tool from the sidebar.

00:00:59.814 --> 00:01:09.158
Read, Annotate, Edit, Pages, Merge, Compare, Convert, Protect and Forms are all one click away.

00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:13.388
Press Control K to search any tool by name.

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:15.109
Step four:

00:01:15.109 --> 00:01:15.899
annotate.

00:01:15.899 --> 00:01:22.401
Choose the highlight tool, the pen, shapes or notes, and mark up the page.

00:01:22.401 --> 00:01:29.343
Colors and opacity are in the panel on the right, and everything can be undone.

00:01:30.173 --> 00:01:31.097
Step five:

00:01:31.097 --> 00:01:31.559
edit.

00:01:31.559 --> 00:01:39.044
Click existing text to rewrite it, or add new text with any font, color and size.

00:01:39.044 --> 00:01:42.926
You can also insert images and signatures.

00:01:43.771 --> 00:01:44.696
Step six:

00:01:44.696 --> 00:01:46.237
organize pages.

00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:53.944
Drag the thumbnails to reorder them, then rotate, delete, extract or split.

00:01:54.772 --> 00:02:04.325
To combine files, open Merge, add several PDFs or images, put them in order, and merge them into one document.

00:02:05.131 --> 00:02:06.093
Step seven:

00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:07.931
compare two versions.

00:02:07.931 --> 00:02:14.579
PDF Do shows the differences side by side and lists every page that changed.

00:02:15.403 --> 00:02:16.499
Step eight:

00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:17.297
convert.

00:02:17.297 --> 00:02:28.361
Export to Word, images, text, Markdown or a web page, or turn scans into searchable PDFs with text recognition.

00:02:29.173 --> 00:02:30.176
Step nine:

00:02:30.176 --> 00:02:32.383
protect your document.

00:02:32.383 --> 00:02:38.401
Set a password, redact sensitive text, or compress the file.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:44.068
Finally, press Control S to save your changes.

00:02:44.068 --> 00:02:45.331
That is all.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.911
PDF Do is free.

00:02:46.911 --> 00:02:51.227
If it helps you, you can buy me a coffee.

00:02:51.227 --> 00:02:53.333
Thanks for watching.

